## @summary Loads every `Build.*` module. Requiring this file requires the build system.

## Reused by nested `dotnet` processes this build spawns, which is where the
## MSBuild nodes that outlive a build come from. See `Dotnet.SafetyArgs`.
$env.MSBUILDDISABLENODEREUSE = "1"

## Foundations: output, filesystem, path containment, the lock.
require ./Core.tosh
require ./Fs.tosh
require ./Safety.tosh
require ./Lock.tosh

## The cross-cutting wrappers. Everything below is written in terms of these.
require ./Runes.tosh

## Shared tables and toolchain access.
require ./Targets.tosh
require ./Dotnet.tosh
require ./History.tosh
require ./Version.tosh

## Capabilities.
require ./Tests.tosh
require ./Clean.tosh
require ./Bench.tosh
require ./Desktop.tosh
require ./Docs.tosh
require ./Vscode.tosh
require ./Package.tosh
require ./Publish.tosh
require ./Report.tosh

## Drives all of the above.
require ./Pipeline.tosh

## The declaration that makes this directory importable as one thing.
export partial module Build
